      "id": "CVE-2026-119028",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-29T11:36:34.692Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-29T14:08:24.785Z",
      "description": "oapi-codegen 2.0.0 before 2.8.1 contains a code injection vulnerability that allows attackers to inject Go code by supplying non-literal enum entries in integer, number, or boolean schemas. Attackers controlling an OpenAPI document can craft an enum entry that closes the const block in constants.tmpl and injects a func init(), executing code when the generated package is built and imported.",
      "severity": 8.8,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：oapi-codegen oapi-codegen\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/oapi-codegen/oapi-codegen/security/advisories/GHSA-g2vv-83pm-v2hc",
